# The Demo of Rabenstein, by Stefan Vogt, played to its ending. A
# night walk through the Black Forest that doubles as the Arcturus
# interpreter author's test game: the walkthrough its own source
# header sets out, visiting a pictured room, a room with no picture
# where the band must clear, a dark room with a scene of its own,
# and a picture that changes in place on an event, repeatably. The
# LOOK commands are here for the rule that a band must not be
# redrawn when the picture has not changed.

look
north
look
north
look
north
look
south
south
take lantern
light lantern
north
north
look
sleep
look
sleep
sleep
south
quit
